Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.57,0:00:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.13,0:00:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you, I, I thought you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yasuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.94,0:01:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yasuko, you did a great\Njob raising Ryuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.12,0:01:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.54,0:01:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she thought I was in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Yasu? It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Ryuichi was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taiga left a message saying I was in\Nbad shape, and Yasuko fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She cried a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she also got an earful from Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.41,0:01:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's like a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:01:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Families?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They haven't seen each other\Nin more than ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't even tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.36,0:02:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.27,0:02:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.19,0:02:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.10,0:02:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.01,0:02:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spoiling her as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why shouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.75,0:02:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she's got to learn to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at her. There's still a family.\NStill hasn't told us why she left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Family, Ryuuji, why don't you take a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.07,0:02:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bath before the water gets cold oh okay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.71,0:02:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you never got married.\NThey told you. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what happened was when i\Nwas pregnant with you your
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.11,0:02:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dad met another girl and took off with her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.63,0:02:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone freaked out and\Nwere telling me i should
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:03:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get an abortion but i\Ncouldn't i made up my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i was gonna have you i\Nwanted to protect you no
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,matter what but i didn't\Ndo a good enough job i
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,failed and everything\Nfell apart that's not true
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did a great job\Nraising me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grandma look can't you see\Nhow tall i've gotten you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.73,0:03:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should be proud really you are tall when
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were running away\Nyou looked so big you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weren't the little guy i knew anymore it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.35,0:03:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,scared the hell out of\Nme and it kind of made
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.26,0:03:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me happy at the same time,\Nbut like watching you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,run away from me like\Nthat i was scared i was
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.27,0:03:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never gonna see you again\Nso you figured you'd
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leave me first that was\Ndumb running away isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna solve anything not that i'm in any
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:04:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,position to talk i 'm\Ngrowing up but i can't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do it without you you have to be there to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keep an eye on me because\Ni want you to okay
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come on stop crying
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.63,0:04:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uh okay your grandma\Nsaid since we're gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,getting married we might\Nas well sleep in the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,same room something tells me grandma might\Nbe the reason for how yasuko turned out
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that? She's\Nlaughing! Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.69,0:04:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, turn off the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why? Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cool, don't you think? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole time, I had a feeling\Nthis was going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the eloping thing wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, didn't care though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a nice dream
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to have for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it was too good to be true,\Ncause everything fell apart again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you and Yasuko are something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are wrong,\Nnothing's falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, the way I see it,\Nthis is where we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need to elope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can get married, fair and square .
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be better if we\Nhad everyone's blessing anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandma and grandpa and your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.10,0:05:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be the happiest\Nday of our lives, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So wouldn't it be cool if we could share\Nit with all the people in our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.90,0:05:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that we're talking about\Nit, we should get some practice in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.76,0:06:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taiga.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I Ryuji Takasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I say next? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Taiga Aisaka, will\Nyou take me for your...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.55,0:06:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the vows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're the one who wanted to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what you told me when we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said I was a tiger\Nand you were a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And only dragons could\Nstand equal with tigers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, we don't need\Nvows like other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because no matter what, we're\Nsupposed to be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are bloodshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your breath stinks. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:07:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your lips are chapped, so\Nit's gonna feel weird if we kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.09,0:07:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Epic fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we kiss, it'll probably hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like kissing the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinda rough and dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And also, burning hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could always try it again, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.16,0:07:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:08:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.37,0:07:57.87,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fs70.500000\fnJapanese Brush\c&H607294&\pos(951.000000,247.500000)}Takasu
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the way here, it was just us two,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now going home, it's us\Nthree, and the pitiful bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you know it was even gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What that Yasu'd come running\Nif we left that message?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.14,0:08:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that she'd make up with\Nyour grandparents after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I wasn't 100% sure\Nit was going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just had this kind of feeling it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's just how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, when you're like a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Taiga, you're coming\Nover for dinner later, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.22,0:08:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're part of the family now, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.24,0:08:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:09:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, Nico, I know. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.23,0:09:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.80,0:09:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.63,0:09:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your mom's in there, and she'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you and explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't take too long, Because tonight\NI'm making your favorite, pork cutlets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taiga, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand the\Nconsequences of your act?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.77,0:09:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:09:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taiga...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hate me that much? You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn what you do or where\Nyou go! Have it your way! I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy now? Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.19,0:10:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, Mom. So childish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ryuuji, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My whole life, I never thought anyone\Nwas ever really going to love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that smells awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.39,0:10:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till you see what else I'm cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.31,0:10:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandma gave me a recipe for taro\Nthat she says will blow your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.73,0:10:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.57,0:10:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was probably just running\Naway, because I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No stars out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.56,0:11:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all tiny and helpless\Nlike me, to say cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.89,0:11:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I blamed my loneliness on my\Nparents, and how they raised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you loved me for who\NI am, didn't you, Ryuji?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why... I'm not\Ngonna run away anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.19,0:11:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll accept who I am, and\Nlearn to be proud of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I can love you. Ryuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That night, Taiga didn't\Nshow up for dinner after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Takasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.27,0:11:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just tell us what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.11,0:11:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where's Taiga? Okay, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I have to\Nstart today on a sad note.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got the news that, due to family\Nissues, Aisaka will be leaving our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her mother called a few minutes\Nago to arrange for her transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said Aisaka is going\Nto live with her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it wasn't a prank caller?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.59,0:12:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she would have told\Nus if she was leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll find yourselves at different\Ncrossroads as you go through life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you can choose to stop, or\Nturn back, or go a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.91,0:12:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The point is, you'll\Nhave to make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.35,0:12:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like Aisaka has.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And unfortunately, that\Nmeant she had to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's thought long and hard\Nabout her decision, and we should
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.65,0:12:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,respect that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, the kitchen's on rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.05,0:12:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put your phones away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in class!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just gave you something to\Nreflect on, and you're texting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.69,0:12:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takasu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back to your seat right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:13:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who she shut up and hold still\Nfor a second okay why the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hell did you come back without her
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this doesn't make any sense\Nwhy is she transferring
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you know you better okay that's enough
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kitamura i didn't know\Ni didn't want to let
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her go and if i could\Nget her to come back i
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would i want to know why she didn't\Ncome and talk to me about this first
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.53,0:13:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trust. She's doing the\Nright thing. So for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can do\NIs accept her decision
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takasu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez She finally learned to clean up
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After herself, figure she'd\Nleave something behind. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we got a lone sock here i can't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.19,0:14:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have that where's your partner i'm\Ngonna find it and reun ite you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what a klutz i guess i figure\Nshe'd leave this stuff behind
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.65,0:14:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are a klutz.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.31,0:14:42.94,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fnHelvetica LT Std Cond\c&H8C7257&\bord0.375000\3c&HD1C0A1&\fay0.13\fscy85.000000\fax-0.25\fs42.000000\pos(1123.500000,262.500000)}1 NEW
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.31,0:14:42.94,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fnHelvetica LT Std Cond\c&H8C7257&\bord0.375000\3c&HD1C0A1&\fay0.13\fscy85.000000\fax-0.25\fs42.000000\pos(1120.500000,288.000000)}MESSAGE
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.31,0:14:42.94,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnHelvetica LT Std Cond\bord0.375000\3c&HD1C0A1&\fay0.12\fscy100.000000\fax-0.25\fs42.000000\pos(1131.000000,336.000000)\c&HBBA39E&}Taiga
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.44,0:14:44.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.5\fay0.12\fax-0.27\fs37.500000\b0\c&HA38D83&\fnCalibri\pos(892.500000,345.000000)}You never
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.44,0:14:44.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.5\fay0.12\fax-0.28\fs37.500000\b0\c&HA38D83&\fnCalibri\pos(882.000000,378.000000)}told me that you
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.44,0:14:44.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.5\fay0.12\fax-0.27\fs37.500000\b0\c&HA38D83&\fnCalibri\pos(873.000000,411.000000)}love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure after I fell\Ninto the river, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.27,0:14:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.18,0:14:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were interrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, how could I tell\NKawashima, but not her?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.29,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fs87.000000\fay0.005\fax-0.005\b0\fnCalibri\c&HA98681&\pos(681.000000,619.500000)}Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:15:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if anyone's klutzier now, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.45,0:15:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tony, are you busy today? No, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.21,0:15:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to stop\Nsomewhere on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you guys seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taiga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the slap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I thought about it and Well,\NI think I get what you were saying
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.53,0:15:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, look, I got a message from Taiga.\NI got one too. Same here. Was it this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.53,0:15:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one that's it looks
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like taiga replied to\Neveryone who texted her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yesterday that's pretty\Ncool huh yeah but why
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did she only send a picture i\Ndon't get it does anyone know
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what it's a picture of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hmm seaweed it's the night sky huh\Nreally no way it is and i think that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tiny light's a star are you sure it's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not a speck of dust it's a star why\Nwould she send a shot of a star i think i
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.99,0:16:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know she's saying she's watching\Nover us oh hey stop talking
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like she's dead i think\Nshe's saying that she's not
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,giving up huh even if the sky's\Nso dark you can't see anything the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.19,0:16:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stars are still up there somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shining so if she can figure out how to\Nshine brighter we 'll be able to see her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm still kind of sad taiga left\Nus like that without telling
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us thing is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we all live under
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:17:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the same big sky don't we so if we all\Nlearn to shine it won't matter where
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we go or how
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,far apart we are if we shine\Nbright enough we'll see each other
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.07,0:17:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gave me the chills it was so
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.72,0:17:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cheesy i think i'm gonna hurl oh shut up i
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like what kushi ata's getting\Nat don't know what she
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,said but it sounded heavy\Nwell i totally get it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.52,0:17:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and i hope she's right me\Ntoo since we're talking
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about stars remember the disaster that\Nalmost ruined the christmas party huh oh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah that one I was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we all sent her a reply,\Nit'd make her really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so where do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.99,0:17:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember where we put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I packed\Nit away with Ami's tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.27,0:17:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to getting\Neveryone fired up, you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.01,0:18:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.82,0:18:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's just me, full of\Nsurprises since the day I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I used to be jealous\Nof how everyone liked her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe the stuff she got\Naway with, and I thought you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,adored her because she was being herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.28,0:18:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.19,0:18:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out the little girl
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the big attitude had a\Nfragile heart as teeny as her
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.69,0:18:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth was, she worried so\Nmuch about what others thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.41,0:18:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She never let anyone see her true self.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of reminds me of someone else I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, and you weren't fooled for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saw right through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You called me a child that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.52,0:18:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw you at the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate how people just assume I'm mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.51,0:18:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I have to act like an\Nadult or I'll disappoint everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.37,0:18:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after seeing how you guys treat Taiga,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized I didn't\Nhave to fake it anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.03,0:18:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because there was someone out there who
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,understood me, and I was cool with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.47,0:19:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,love me, I found the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me hearties.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.40,0:19:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I don't know which button to press.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teach, hurry up and take the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.81,0:19:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to lose
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my patron saint powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, smile, Takasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.46,0:19:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said, "Smile." I am smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.87,0:19:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's help him, Amin, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.04,0:19:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.62,0:19:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for centuries, only dragons and\Ntigers have been considered equals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it doesn't matter you're\Nnot here with me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'll transcend space and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I can always be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my feelings for you\Nwill never, ever change.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.94,0:20:17.98,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}They're similar, yet different
